          }
        ],
        "text": "第一冬教会你的读迹方法已被写进北坡巡查图，成为别人也能沿用的路线。"
      },
      {
        "conditions": [
          {
            "requirement_id": "quarter_worker_growth_present",
            "label": "第一冬形成风雪中的稳手",
            "mode": "all",
            "conditions": [{"kind": "talent", "talent_def_id": "talent.winter_steady_worker"}]
          }
        ],
        "text": "你手上的劳茧没有白留，霍克把一段融雪墙巡正式交给了你。"
      },
      {
        "conditions": [
          {
            "requirement_id": "quarter_fire_growth_present",
            "label": "第一冬形成火边留席",
            "mode": "all",
            "conditions": [{"kind": "talent", "talent_def_id": "talent.fire_circle_seat"}]
